With N >= 2^68 (Barina 2020 verification, CITED) tier A holds for every L <= 14878195707 (about sqrt(3*2^68/4) = 14878203147);
  every positive 3n+1 cycle of odd length L <= 14878195707 has K/L (reduced) a convergent of log_2 3 (Eliahou 1993 mechanism).

